<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">About US </h1>
    <h6>
        We understand why your critical business services are so important to your daily operations.  ITA has identified a significant disconnect between business operations and technology.

        We have spent valuable time aligning our technology to support business initiatives to bridge the gap between these two aspects, by way of providing detailed monthly, quarterly and annual executive reports.

        Too many well established, profitable businesses lack a birds eye view of critical data that should form part of a Managed Report or the Boardroom Pack.
    </h6>
        <h6>
            This information allows for educated data driven decision making.

            We find that 100% of SME’s we encounter do not have a diagnostic measurable tool for the purpose of targeting specific areas of their network that are essential to the overall performance and critical uptime.

            With IT as the second largest cost centre to human capital; it is a crucial part of your core business infrastructure and should be treated as such.
        </h6>
</div>

<div class="text-center mb-4">
