</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <p>
            IT Anywhere was established in 2014 and within subsequent years has become a forerunner
            in connecting business and technology through network audits, proactive device and server
            management, with detailed reporting.
        </p>
        <p>
            Building a program that relies on around-the-clock network monitoring coupled with an
            aggressive preventative maintenance component ensures optimum uptime for your business.
        </p>
        <p>
            We provide first and second line support to your internal IT department &mdash; allowing
            your team to work <em>on</em> your business while we work <em>in</em> your business, or
            alternatively function as your dedicated IT department.
        </p>
        <p>
            One of the major challenges in maintaining a computer network is trying to predict what
            will fail, and when.
        </p>
        <p>
            With our down-to-business services solution, we prevent and mitigate possible network
            failures before they occur. By combining regular and comprehensive real-time monitoring
            of your critical network and desktop devices, we ensure the reliability and stability of
            your IT assets.
        </p>
